//! `--stream --slurp` print, and the exit status of a stream that does not parse, must not move.
//! Every row was captured from jq 1.7.1 (`/usr/bin/jq`); rows where `succinctly jq` is known to
//! differ (the documented streaming-parser gaps) are not pinned here.

